pm init <OPTIONAL name>:
    if not name, create the structure in the current directory, else, creates the directory with the project structure


pm add <name>:
    creates include/name.h and src/name.c


pm remove <name>:
    remove the project


pm run <OPTIONAL name>:
    if not name, try to run whatever is in the binary dir, if not binary dir, error message, run the project with this <name>

